			"Message": "feat(Cocoon/Shim): Add dynamic ES module shim generator for vscode API surface\n\nIntroduces a TypeScript module that dynamically generates ES Module-compatible shims for the vscode API surface. This enables extensions using ES Module syntax (`import { window } from 'vscode'`) to properly resolve the shimmed API instances provided by the Cocoon sidecar.\n\n- Generates runtime-specific module content using API key injection and property enumeration\n- Dynamically creates export statements for all properties on the vscode API instance\n- Uses template replacement pattern to maintain separation of concerns between shim logic and raw JS template\n- Implements validation checks for API key and instance integrity\n\nSupports MVP Path A goals by enhancing the Cocoon sidecar's ability to host unmodified VS Code extensions through improved module resolution capabilities. This shim layer is critical for maintaining compatibility with extensions expecting CommonJS-style imports while transitioning to ES Module patterns.\n\nRefs #7684196 (Mountain/Environment IPC infrastructure)",
