			"Message": "feat(Mountain/Environment): Implement UI provider trait for frontend interaction bridge\n\nImplements `UiProvider` trait in `MountainEnvironment` to connect abstract UI effects with concrete handler logic. This bridges the environment's capabilities with Tauri-based UI handlers that communicate with the `Sky` frontend through the `Echo` API contract.\n\n- Adds implementations for 5 core UI interaction methods: `ShowMessage`, `ShowOpenDialog`, `ShowSaveDialog`, `ShowQuickPick`, and `ShowInputBox`\n- Delegates to dedicated UI handlers that manage both native dialogs and IPC communication with the Astro frontend\n- Enables environment-aware UI interactions through the `Track` dispatcher\n- Follows recent work on UI payload structures (#61244c5) by providing concrete implementations\n\nThis foundational work supports MVP Deliverable #1 (Core Editor Functionality) by establishing critical user interaction pathways between Rust backend and TypeScript frontend components.",
