			"Message": "feat(Mountain/Environment): Add generic UI request payload structure for frontend communication\n\nIntroduces `UiRequestPayload<PayloadType>` struct to standardize UI request formatting between Mountain backend and Sky frontend via Vine IPC. This structure:\n- Provides consistent request shape with unique `RequestIdentifier` for tracking asynchronous responses\n- Uses generic `PayloadType` to support various UI interactions (dialogs, quick picks, etc.)\n- Implements serialization via Serde for compatibility with Echo API contract\n\nAligns with MVP Path A requirements by enabling reliable UI command routing through Track dispatcher. Forms foundation for implementing specific UI handlers in Mountain's environment runtime while maintaining separation between native logic and frontend presentation layer.",
