			"Message": "feat(Mountain/Environment): Implement document provider trait for environment\n\nAdd concrete implementation of `DocumentProvider` trait in Mountain environment to handle core document operations through the effect system. This connects:\n\n- File open/save/save-as workflows to `Handlers::Documents` logic\n- Versioned document changes with undo/redo tracking\n- Bulk save operations through `HandleSaveAllDocumentsEffectLogic`\n\nImplements critical path for MVP Deliverable #2 (File System Operations) by:\n1. Providing native Rust handlers for document persistence via `River`/`Sun`\n2. Enabling UI document management through `Echo` API contract\n3. Supporting future extension operations via `Cocoon` shims\n\nLogging decorators maintain alignment with Mountain's operational telemetry strategy. The `Requires` implementation enables dependency injection within the environment's effect system, following patterns established in recent configuration provider commits.",
