			"Message": "feat(Mountain/Environment): Implement configuration provider and inspector traits\n\n- Introduces `ConfigProvider` and `ConfigInspector` trait implementations for `MountainEnvironment`\n- Connects configuration management to Mountain's AppState and handler infrastructure\n- Enables core configuration operations required for editor personalization and extension functionality\n- Implements `GetConfigurationValue`/`UpdateConfigurationValue` with proper resource override handling\n- Adds temporary warning for scope inspection limitations in `InspectConfigurationValue`\n- Integrates with configuration handlers for file I/O and state synchronization\n- Supports MVP deliverable #1 (runnable app) by providing essential configuration surface\n- Builds on recent runtime trait work (97be6e6) to expand Mountain's effect implementation\n- Uses Tauri's app handle to resolve configuration paths for different scopes\n- Implements DI requirements through `Requires` trait for service location",
