			"Message": "feat(Mountain/Environment): Implement CommandExecutor trait for Mountain runtime environment\n\nIntroduces concrete implementation of the `CommandExecutor` trait in `MountainEnvironment`, enabling command execution capabilities required for the effect-based runtime system. This implementation:\n\n- Connects abstract command effects to concrete handlers in `Mountain`\n- Provides execution, registration, and unregistration methods for commands\n- Integrates with Tauri's window management and `AppRuntime` state\n- Implements error handling for command lifecycle operations\n- Supports command routing between core application and sidecar processes like `Cocoon`\n\nThis forms a critical part of the runtime environment's command infrastructure, enabling `Track` dispatcher to execute commands through Mountain's native logic flow. The implementation directly supports MVP Path A requirements by establishing the foundation for extension command handling through `Cocoon` sidecar interactions via `Vine` IPC.\n\nRefs #97be6e6 (Add core runtime traits)",
