			"Message": "feat(Common): Add core runtime traits for effect execution environment\n\nIntroduces `AppRuntimeTrait` and `DefaultRuntime` implementation to establish foundation for Mountain's effect-based system. This enables:\n- Standardized environment access through `GetEnvironment` method\n- Declarative effect execution via `Run` method constrained by environment capabilities\n- Generic handling of async operations through `ActionEffect` integration\n\nAligns with Land's architecture by:\n1. Formalizing the runtime contract between Track dispatcher and Environment\n2. Supporting future extension hosts through generic effect requirements\n3. Building on recent Environment/ActionEffect work (Refs be57393)\n4. Providing common infrastructure for both Cocoon (Path A) and future Grove (Path B) runtime interactions\n\nThis foundational component directly contributes to MVP deliverable #7 (build system) by enabling proper effect execution in Mountain's Rust backend.",
