			"Message": "feat(Common): Add filesystem effect handlers for standardized I/O operations\n\n- Introduce `FsReader` and `FsWriter` traits to abstract filesystem operations through Land's effect system\n- Implement `ActionEffect` handlers for core FS operations (read/write files, directory management) using dependency injection\n- Aligns with Mountain's runtime environment requirements for async I/O operations\n- Provides foundation for River/Sun integration while maintaining compatibility with Cocoon-sidecar operations\n- Enables consistent error handling through recently added `CommonError` enum\n- Supports MVP deliverable #2 (File System Operations) by establishing effect-based API surface\n- Follows pattern established in previous `ActionEffect` implementation for declarative environment interactions",
