			"Message": "feat(Common): Implement cross-component error enum\n\nIntroduce universal CommonError type to standardize error handling across Mountain and other Land components. This enum:\n- Consolidates 20+ error variants covering filesystem operations (River/Sun), configuration, IPC (Vine), command execution (Track), and provider interactions\n- Uses thiserror for rich error messages with path/context details\n- Implements From traits for seamless std::io and serde error conversion\n- Enables serialization for IPC error passing between Mountain and Cocoon sidecar\n- Serves as foundation for consistent error reporting in Echo API contract\n\nSupports MVP deliverable #5 (Cocoon integration) by ensuring Node.js sidecar can receive structured error objects from Mountain during extension operations. The explicit error categories align with Land's focus on robust FS operations and IPC reliability.",
