			"Message": "feat(Environment): Add ActionEffect struct for declarative async operations\n\nIntroduces foundational `ActionEffect` type in Mountain's runtime to model environment-dependent async operations using a functional approach. The generic struct:\n- Encapsulates async functions requiring Environment accessor\n- Uses Arc-wrapped closures for cloneable effect definitions\n- Enables declarative command pattern for Track dispatcher\n- Supports dependency injection through environment access\n\nThis architectural primitive directly supports Land's phased evolution by:\n1. Providing core building block for Mountain's effect-based runtime\n2. Facilitating future integration with Cocoon RPC handlers\n3. Enabling cleaner separation between command definitions and environment interactions\n4. Laying groundwork for Grove extension host integration\n\nStructure aligns with MVP Path A requirements for robust command handling while establishing patterns usable across both Node.js and native extension hosts.",
