			"Message": "feat(AppState): Add memento storage loading from disk\n\nImplement initial persistence layer for loading extension/editor state from JSON storage files. This supports Land's state restoration capabilities by:\n- Creating `LoadInitialMementoStorageFromDisk` function in Mountain's AppState\n- Handling file I/O using Rust's native FS operations (aligns with River/Sun pattern)\n- Implementing error-tolerant JSON parsing with logging\n- Returning empty storage when files missing/corrupted to prevent startup failures\n\nEnables future extension state persistence required for VS Code compatibility in Cocoon sidecar. Provides foundation for:\n- Restoring workspace state across editor sessions\n- Managing extension-specific storage\n- Supporting vscode.Memento API shims in Path A implementation\n\nLogging integration helps diagnose state loading issues during MVP testing phase.",
