			"Message": "feat(AppState): Add hierarchy session context tracking for language feature providers\n\nIntroduces `HierarchySessionContext` struct to maintain state for call/type hierarchy sessions initiated by language providers. This enables:\n- Tracking originating provider handle and sidecar identifier\n- Proper routing of subsequent hierarchy requests to correct providers\n- Support for stateful language features in extension host architecture\n\nAligns with MVP Path A goals by providing necessary infrastructure for `Cocoon` sidecar to handle complex editor features like call hierarchy navigation. The context binding ensures extension-provided services maintain session continuity across multiple IPC interactions with `Mountain` backend.\n\nPrepares for implementation of VS Code-compatible hierarchy UI in `Sky` frontend while maintaining strict provider-process isolation through sidecar identifiers.",
