			"Message": "feat(AppState): Add core document state structure with change tracking\n\nIntroduces the `DocumentState` struct to represent open text documents in Mountain's application state, supporting:\n- Version tracking and validation to prevent stale updates\n- Line-based content storage with EOL normalization\n- Full text replacement and incremental change application patterns\n- Dirty state flagging for unsaved changes\n\nAligns with Land's MVP deliverable #1 (runnable core editor) by providing:\n1. Centralized document state management for `Sky` frontend interactions via `Echo` API\n2. Foundation for `Track` dispatcher to handle document operations from `Cocoon` extensions\n3. Integration with recent RPC serialization work (`TypeConverter`, `ProtoValueConverter`)\n4. Structured logging to support debugging of document lifecycle events\n\nThe change handling logic supports both VS Code-compatible RPC change DTOs and raw text replacements, enabling compatibility with `Cocoon` shims while maintaining native Rust efficiency.",
			"SHA": "220df7cb27c0354d522095444f5f868813e495ad"
		},
