			],
			"Message": "feat(AppState): Implement merged configuration state management\n\nIntroduce `MergedConfigurationState` struct to handle unified configuration storage and retrieval for Land's core application state. This structure:\n- Stores merged settings from all sources (user/workspace/etc) as JSON data\n- Provides methods for section-based value lookup supporting VS Code-style dotted keys\n- Implements scope determination heuristics for RPC communication with extension hosts\n- Integrates with `ConfigurationScope` from common effects to support IPC workflows\n\nThis foundational component enables consistent configuration handling between Mountain's native logic and Cocoon-side extensions via Vine IPC. The scope-based routing supports MVP Path A's shim architecture by properly categorizing settings for Window vs Resource scoped operations. Includes logging instrumentation to support debugging of configuration propagation through the system.",
			"SHA": "89430f2b2d2940b4aeb555a66007bbabdf4949f5"
