			"Message": "feat(AppState): Add text line analysis utility for document state management\n\n- Introduces `AnalyzeTextLinesAndEol` function to detect line endings and split content\n- Returns tuple containing line vector and detected EOL string (LF/CRLF)\n- Uses platform-agnostic splitting to support cross-platform file handling requirements\n- Serves as foundational component for Mountain's document state tracking\n- Enables consistent line processing between Sky frontend and Mountain backend\n- Prepares for future text manipulation features in MVP Path A (Cocoon integration)\n\nRefs #ceee8c4f780030bffff135747a0bb8020f2b5a4d",
