			"Message": "feat(Vine): Implement core gRPC service module for Mountain IPC\n\nAdds foundational gRPC server module structure in Mountain's Vine IPC layer to handle communication with Cocoon sidecar processes. This establishes the server-side implementation of the Vine transport layer defined in MVP Path A requirements.\n\n- Creates `MountainVineGrpcService` module containing service logic for Mountain's gRPC endpoints\n- Sets up module exports to integrate with Track command dispatcher\n- Follows up on previous client-side gRPC implementation (8704966)\n- Enables bidirectional communication between Mountain and Node.js sidecars as part of Cocoon extension host integration\n\nThis server module forms the backbone for handling RPC calls from extensions via Cocoon shims, advancing deliverable #5 (Basic Extension Support) by implementing native Rust handlers for extension APIs.",
			"SHA": "98f5b90165b02fc7067b7578b99f3a39eb6e75ee"
