			],
			"Message": "feat(Vine): Add gRPC client/server modules for Cocoon IPC\n\n- Introduces gRPC-based IPC infrastructure between Mountain (Rust) and Cocoon (Node.js) as part of MVP Path A implementation\n- Implements manual Protobuf-like message definitions (VineGrpcManual) as interim solution pending full .proto code generation\n- Establishes client-side service connectors (Connect, SendRequest, etc.) for Mountain-initiated communication\n- Creates server-side MountainVineGrpcService to handle incoming RPCs from Cocoon extensions\n- Adds VineError type for structured IPC error handling\n- Maintains legacy VineMessage structs from stdio IPC phase for compatibility during transition\n\nThis foundational IPC layer enables secure, structured communication required for:\n1. Shim-mediated extension API calls in Cocoon sidecar\n2. Future expansion to alternative extension hosts (Grove/Mist)\n3. Adherence to Echo API contract through strongly-typed RPCs\n\nRefs #ebd2fd9 (Track dispatcher initialization)",
