			"Message": "feat(Track): Initialize core command dispatch module structure\n\nAdded foundational components for Mountain's Track dispatcher system to handle routing of Sky frontend commands and Cocoon sidecar requests. The new module includes:\n- SkyCommandDto for structured frontend command data transfer\n- EffectCreationError handling for robust error propagation\n- Base Track dispatch logic scaffolding\n\nThis establishes the routing infrastructure required for MVP Path A's command flow between Sky UI actions and Mountain's native handlers. The structure enables future expansion for RPC forwarding to Cocoon extensions while maintaining separation of concerns between UI command processing and sidecar communication layers.\n\nAligns with MVP deliverable #1 (core editor functionality) by providing the backend command routing needed for basic editor operations initiated from the frontend.",
