			"Message": "feat(Rpc): Add main thread status bar handler for extension UI integration\n\nImplements status bar management RPC handler in Mountain backend to enable Cocoon sidecar extensions to interact with the editor's status bar. The handler emits Tauri events (`mountain:statusbar_set_entry` and `mountain:statusbar_dispose_entry`) that will be consumed by the Sky frontend to update UI elements.\n\n- Follows pattern established by recent RPC handlers for logs (1a05fb1) and messages (1e028e6)\n- Uses structured argument types from `Args::StatusBar` module\n- Implements error handling with standardized error codes (`EEMIT_STATUSBAR_*`)\n- Includes detailed logging at multiple levels for debugging\n- Enables MVP Path A extension support by providing critical UI surface area for extensions\n- Prepares for future status bar state management in AppState\n\nContributes to MVP deliverable #5 (Basic Extension Support) by expanding the RPC surface available to Cocoon-hosted extensions through the Vine IPC layer.",
			"SHA": "23b8251e09cab62f58a5e5f9056b63743ad0b1f6"
