			"Message": "feat(Rpc): Add main thread secrets handler for secure extension credential management\n\nIntroduce MainThreadSecretsHandler in Mountain backend to handle secret storage operations requested by Cocoon sidecar extensions via Vine IPC. Implements GetPassword, SetPassword and DeletePassword methods using:\n- Common::SecretsEffects for system keyring integration\n- AppRuntime's effect execution system\n- Standardized error mapping through ErrorUtils\n\nThis enables VS Code-compatible secret storage API surface through Shims in Path A (Cocoon), supporting extensions requiring secure credential storage. The handler follows established RPC patterns seen in recent log and UI notification handlers, advancing MVP deliverable #5 (basic extension support).\n\nSecret management operates through Mountain's native Rust implementation (River/Sun modules not required here), ensuring secure storage while maintaining process isolation from extension host. Structured logging in each method supports debugging without exposing sensitive data.",
