			],
			"Message": "feat(Rpc): Add message display handler for sidecar UI notifications\n\nIntroduces MainThreadMessageHandler in Mountain to process UI message requests from the Cocoon sidecar via Vine IPC. This enables VS Code extensions running in the Node.js sidecar to show native dialogs/notifications through Land's UI:\n\n- Maps VS Code severity levels (1=Info, 2=Warning, 3=Error) to CommonMessageSeverity enum\n- Integrates with AppRuntime's effect system via UiEffects::ShowMessage\n- Handles message text and optional UI options from extension requests\n- Implements structured error handling with RPC parameter validation\n\nThis directly supports MVP Path A's extension integration by providing user feedback mechanisms required for extension operations. The handler follows the pattern established in recent RPC handlers for logs and lifecycle events, advancing deliverable #5 (basic extension support) through native UI interaction capabilities.",
			"SHA": "1e028e685b8592a0dc02f91c40dc8229ee9402f3"
