			],
			"Message": "feat(Rpc): Add main thread log handler for Cocoon extension host\n\nIntroduces `MainThreadLogHandler` struct to process log messages from the Cocoon sidecar via Vine IPC. This enables proper logging of extension host activities in Mountain's native Rust environment:\n\n- Maps VS Code extension host log levels (0-5) to Rust's `log` crate levels\n- Formats message parts from JSON arguments into cohesive log entries\n- Annotates logs with `[Cocoon ExtHost Log RPC]` prefix for traceability\n- Integrates with Land's RPC error handling utilities through `ErrorUtils`\n\nSupports MVP Path A goals by improving observability of extensions running in the Node.js sidecar. This handler works with Cocoon's shim layer to surface extension-generated logs through Mountain's native logging system, essential for debugging during early extension integration phases. The implementation follows established patterns seen in recent RPC handler commits for lifecycle and document management.",
