			"Message": "feat(Rpc): Add main thread handler for extension lifecycle events\n\nIntroduce `MainThreadExtensionServiceHandler` to manage extension activation notifications from the `Cocoon` sidecar. This handler:\n- Processes `OnWillActivateExtension`, `OnDidActivateExtension`, `OnExtensionActivationError`, and `OnExtensionRuntimeError` events\n- Integrates with `Handlers::ExtensionStatus` to propagate state changes\n- Uses warning-level logging for development visibility of extension host interactions\n\nAligns with MVP Path A goals by enabling critical extension lifecycle tracking between `Mountain` backend and Node.js sidecar. Provides foundation for:\n- Real-time extension status updates in `Sky` frontend via `Echo` API\n- Error reporting infrastructure for `Cocoon`-hosted extensions\n- Future integration with `Track` dispatcher for command routing\n\nPart of ongoing RPC handler implementation following commits db3837c (extension enablement) and e95009e (document management).",
