			"Message": "feat(Rpc): Add RPC handler for extension enablement state management\n\nImplement MainThreadExtensionEnablementHandler to manage extension activation states through Mountain's RPC layer. This enables:\n- Retrieval of current enablement status via GetEnablementState\n- Bulk updates of extension states through SetEnablement\n- Serialization/deserialization of VS Code extension identifier DTOs\n- Delegation to centralized Enablement handlers for business logic\n\nAligns with MVP Path A requirements by enabling Cocoon sidecar to honor extension state changes made through the Sky UI. Uses VS Code's native EnablementState types to maintain compatibility with existing extensions while routing requests through Mountain's Track dispatcher. Includes structured logging and error handling following Land's RPC error conventions.\n\nContributes to MVP deliverable #5 (Basic Extension Support) by providing critical extension management infrastructure for the Cocoon/Shim architecture.",
			"SHA": "db3837cf496e4d2b97d45532c1cd293efe5f0435"
		},
