			],
			"Message": "feat(Rpc): Implement document management RPC handlers for sidecar integration\n\nAdded MainThreadDocumentsHandler to handle document operations (open/create/save/saveAs/saveAll) from the Cocoon sidecar via Vine IPC. This bridges extension API calls to Mountain's native document effects:\n\n- Implements TryOpenDocument, TryCreateDocument, TrySaveDocument, TrySaveDocumentAs, and SaveAll methods\n- Maps DTO parameters to DocumentsEffects::OpenDocument/SaveDocument/SaveDocumentAs/SaveAllDocuments\n- Integrates with AppRuntime to execute native FS operations via River/Sun\n- Provides detailed logging and error mapping using CommonError utilities\n\nThis enables VS Code extension compatibility by handling the ExtHostDocuments shim requests in Path A MVP architecture. The URI parsing and serialization follow VS Code's document URI conventions to maintain extension compatibility while leveraging native Rust filesystem operations.",
			"SHA": "e95009ed47029a583d0f0a09823ba4a6dae7ae20"
		},
