			"Message": "feat(Echo): Add window management RPC argument DTOs\n\nIntroduce structured argument definitions for window-related RPC methods in Mountain's IPC layer. This includes:\n- AsExternalUriArgument with options DTO for URI transformation requests\n- OpenUriArgument with options DTO for URI handling operations\n\nThese DTOs implement the Echo API contract requirements for serialization between Sky's frontend and Mountain's backend. The modular structure aligns with Track dispatcher patterns, enabling proper routing of window management commands through Vine IPC. This foundational work supports upcoming implementation of:\n- Protocol handler registration (vscode://)\n- Extension-initiated URI operations\n- Cross-window communication flows\n\nPart of MVP Deliverable #5 (Basic Extension Support) by establishing required IPC message formats for Cocoon-hosted extensions to interact with native window management features.",
			"SHA": "d84d3a2ebdf37548c514b06e00ae0d0f723890dd"
