			"Message": "feat(Echo): Add argument DTOs for AsExternalUri RPC method\n\nIntroduces `AsExternalUriArgument` and `OptionsDto` structs in `Mountain` to handle deserialization of RPC arguments for external URI processing. This aligns with the `Echo` API contract requirements for URI handling between `Sky` frontend and `Mountain` backend.\n\n- Defines structured arguments for AsExternalUri RPC method using serde\n- Supports optional contributed opener handling through `AllowContributedOpeners` flag\n- Enables proper deserialization of URI components via `Value` type\n- Prepares foundation for extension-contributed URI handlers in `Cocoon` sidecar\n\nThese DTOs facilitate VS Code-compatible URI resolution while maintaining Land's strict IPC communication patterns through `Vine`. The structure mirrors required extension API surface while enforcing type safety in Rust backend.",
